      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b659e3fbcbd0157201807349",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『维多利亚英里赛』是\n在春天于东京比赛场举办的GⅠ比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06e519ab89f4bb8402a279686a3c10180f7a36ffb61a63b53479e97fbf1f984",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aad11f8b13f9cd202effd700",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是古马级后冠赛马娘争夺英里最强的决战――\n换言之，也就是春季“女王”的决定战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb4605334e7d6adc8032b47ac42fa49812465ef3412e091862e52489e0c98f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77eb4844912005a85b84e940",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于志在重夺“女王”宝座的旺紫丁来说，\n我认为是十分合适的比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "401f2eca8e2db786ff5be6a8c2a803191882cc4566678b03d8293660adba586a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02ef1699300de20ddfe6349",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你有什么别的想法吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a44a6229a7fe8a81584598678f480a3d76cf2c440f1b547bb9016a46d574d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
